	(text_box "SBB0: -> wird nie eingeschaltet! Disable the output (CNFG_SBBx_B.EN_SBBx[2:0] = 0x4 or 0x5)\nSBB1: VD_NRF und VD_MSP = 3.3V\nSBB2: V_LED = 4.4V\n\nAll from V_SYS\nSBB1 starts at 1.8V, turns on nRF, then nRF switches SBB1 to 3.3V"
